WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 41= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:41.560 --> 01:43.840
I knew Xiuru understood what was at stake,

8
01:44.359 --> 01:46.120
so I showed her a way forward.

9
01:46.920 --> 01:47.599
You two

10
01:48.920 --> 01:51.280
shouldn't blame her for going to such lengths.

11
01:51.736 --> 01:52.710
Mother, you don't need

12
01:52.719 --> 01:54.480
to take the blame upon yourself.

13
01:55.159 --> 01:57.000
Xiuru is quick-witted

14
01:57.079 --> 01:58.200
and decisive.

15
01:58.616 --> 02:00.400
When something seemed wrong with Du Cuique,

16
02:00.640 --> 02:02.239
she was the first to notice.

17
02:03.439 --> 02:06.200
Now, to protect herself and her children,

18
02:06.392 --> 02:08.250
she had no choice but to resort to this plan.

19
02:09.120 --> 02:11.599
Neither Young Master nor I hold it against her.

20
02:19.680 --> 02:21.479
Those who help pave the way for others

21
02:22.400 --> 02:23.560
will find their own path

22
02:23.759 --> 02:25.520
growing wider as well.

23
02:27.432 --> 02:28.870
Thank you for your guidance, Mother.

24
02:31.479 --> 02:32.800
You all heard that, didn't you?

25
02:41.176 --> 02:42.790
Thank you, Uncle Jinqi and Aunt Lanxiang,

26
02:42.800 --> 02:44.184
for giving us a new lease on life.

27
02:45.280 --> 02:46.199
Get up.

28
02:47.080 --> 02:47.879
You stay seated.

29
02:48.919 --> 02:50.199
You deserve

30
02:51.120 --> 02:52.400
their gratitude.

31
03:10.072 --> 03:11.992
Thank you, Uncle Jinqi and Aunt Lanxiang,

32
03:12.000 --> 03:13.752
- for giving us a new lease on life. - for giving us a new lease on life.

33
03:16.080 --> 03:18.000
This was Xiuru's idea.

34
03:18.168 --> 03:21.176
She doesn't want them to go through life unaware of the world around them.

35
03:21.800 --> 03:22.840
From an early age,

36
03:23.080 --> 03:25.400
they must understand the situation they're in.

37
03:26.919 --> 03:27.879
The Marquis's residence

38
03:28.639 --> 03:30.840
is both the home on which their lives depend

39
03:31.680 --> 03:34.199
and a place where they must tread carefully.

40
03:35.439 --> 03:37.759
They mustn't let a life of apparent luxury

41
03:38.280 --> 03:39.759
cloud their judgment.

42
03:43.039 --> 03:44.439
Xiuru

43
03:46.639 --> 03:47.960
is being awfully hard on them.

44
03:51.368 --> 03:53.120
What good is it raising this whole family?

45
03:53.120 --> 03:54.610
You don't know what's good for you

46
03:54.639 --> 03:55.759
or what truly matters.

47
03:56.560 --> 03:58.199
There's no point in raising any of you.

48
03:58.232 --> 03:59.752
You're still pretending to be pitiful.

49
04:00.400 --> 04:01.400
And you say you're not?

50
04:02.200 --> 04:03.240
I'll beat you to death.

51
04:03.864 --> 04:05.430
Go on, keep pretending to be pitiful.

52
04:05.439 --> 04:07.039
Let's see you shed some tears.

53
04:07.240 --> 04:08.639
Are you satisfied

54
04:10.360 --> 04:11.960
with how this grand drama turned out?

55
04:15.719 --> 04:18.279
I used to sit down there,

56
04:19.079 --> 04:20.279
but now that I'm standing here,

57
04:21.240 --> 04:22.279
I've realized

58
04:23.040 --> 04:25.040
that while we watched the performances from below,

59
04:26.199 --> 04:28.160
those above were watching our performance, too.

60
04:38.480 --> 04:39.759
From the very beginning,

61
04:40.168 --> 04:42.480
you never really cared whether I took a concubine or not.

62
04:45.160 --> 04:46.160
I do care.

63
04:46.584 --> 04:48.600
Would that stop you from taking one, Your Lordship?

64
04:53.040 --> 04:54.480
Whether I care or not,

65
04:55.279 --> 04:57.680
you will take a concubine for the sake of an heir anyway.

66
04:59.120 --> 05:00.160
So why should it matter

67
05:00.319 --> 05:01.600
whether I care?

68
05:14.504 --> 05:16.190
For the sake of my daughters' reputations,

69
05:16.800 --> 05:18.199
I'll be a virtuous wife

70
05:19.480 --> 05:21.839
and arrange a grand concubine-taking ceremony,

71
05:22.720 --> 05:24.040
to satisfy Old Madam

72
05:25.079 --> 05:27.079
and leave the clansmen nothing to criticize.

73
05:27.220 --> 05:32.460
♪The wind scatters the clouds, and rain turns to mud♪

74
05:33.100 --> 05:38.060
♪Memories of the past rise in my heart♪

75
05:38.620 --> 05:43.620
♪Faded ink turns fragrant, spring rises and summer grows♪

76
05:43.620 --> 05:46.940
♪As if time itself were flowing♪

77
05:46.940 --> 05:50.260
♪Pausing, then rewinding♪

78
05:51.300 --> 05:53.820
♪I watch the long road wind and turn♪

79
05:53.820 --> 05:56.900
♪Even the clamor falls silent♪

80
05:56.900 --> 06:02.060
♪The keepsake rests against my heart as I quietly wait♪

81
06:02.460 --> 06:04.900
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

82
06:04.900 --> 06:08.580
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

83
06:08.580 --> 06:15.820
♪The past falls like withered leaves into the dust♪

84
06:24.800 --> 06:26.160
What are you doing?

85
06:29.680 --> 06:31.680
Whatever you have to say, just tell me.

86
06:31.704 --> 06:32.920
If Young Madam doesn't agree,

87
06:33.399 --> 06:34.680
we dare not get up.

88
06:37.879 --> 06:38.839
Go ahead.

89
06:48.279 --> 06:49.240
Young Madam,

90
06:49.839 --> 06:51.160
I've already chosen a husband.

91
06:52.519 --> 06:53.199
What?

92
06:53.680 --> 06:54.759
It's Xiaolian's family.

93
06:54.872 --> 06:56.360
I want to marry Xiaolian's brother,

94
06:56.560 --> 06:57.480
Du Dasong.

95
06:59.160 --> 07:00.199
What?

96
07:01.120 --> 07:02.480
You want to marry my brother?

97
07:04.160 --> 07:05.439
When did this happen?

98
07:05.560 --> 07:06.240
Yes.

99
07:06.560 --> 07:07.639
When did this happen?

100
07:08.839 --> 07:10.240
I made up my mind long ago.

101
07:10.639 --> 07:12.800
But one thing after another kept happening.

102
07:13.439 --> 07:14.959
First, we were mourning Old Madam.

103
07:15.439 --> 07:16.319
Then,

104
07:16.759 --> 07:18.199
Xiaolian's grandmother passed away.

105
07:18.879 --> 07:21.240
After that, Fourth Young Lady was getting married,

106
07:21.310 --> 07:22.600
and Young Madam became pregnant.

107
07:22.888 --> 07:25.190
I simply couldn't find a chance to tell you, Young Madam.

108
07:27.079 --> 07:28.480
Then explain it to me carefully.

109
07:29.240 --> 07:30.360
If your reasons make sense,

110
07:30.680 --> 07:32.600
I might just agree.

111
07:35.600 --> 07:36.920
They say a woman's marriage

112
07:37.000 --> 07:38.360
should be decided by her parents.

113
07:38.370 --> 07:39.990
But my mother cares too much about money.

114
07:40.279 --> 07:41.439
I don't trust

115
07:41.464 --> 07:42.680
the family she'd choose for me.

116
07:43.256 --> 07:45.120
After serving Young Madam for so many years,

117
07:45.336 --> 07:47.120
I may not have learned many other things,

118
07:47.592 --> 07:49.460
but I did learn not to resign myself to fate.

119
07:49.759 --> 07:50.879
I'm the one getting married.

120
07:51.000 --> 07:53.340
I'm the one who'll spend my life with my husband's family.

121
07:53.600 --> 07:55.639
So I should make the decision myself.

122
07:58.160 --> 08:00.399
Xiaolian and I share a room,

123
08:00.680 --> 08:02.759
and I often hear her talk about her family.

124
08:03.040 --> 08:04.480
She said her father died young,

125
08:04.839 --> 08:06.680
and the family spent all their savings

126
08:07.199 --> 08:08.639
trying to treat his illness.

127
08:08.640 --> 08:10.488
They were also left with a great deal of debt.

128
08:10.520 --> 08:12.920
Her older brother has never been able to arrange a marriage.

129
08:13.959 --> 08:15.000
I thought about it.

130
08:15.480 --> 08:17.800
Granny Du cares deeply for her daughter-in-law,

131
08:18.360 --> 08:20.519
and Xiaolian's mother cares deeply for her daughter.

132
08:21.040 --> 08:24.000
So I figured the son they raised couldn't be a bad man either.

133
08:24.800 --> 08:26.560
When Xiaolian went home,

134
08:27.160 --> 08:27.959
I went with her

135
08:28.600 --> 08:30.480
to meet her older brother.

136
08:33.000 --> 08:35.399
Sure enough, he was steady and mature.

137
08:36.360 --> 08:37.279
It's just that

138
08:38.440 --> 08:39.759
I don't know

139
08:40.320 --> 08:42.120
how Xiaolian's brother feels about me.

140
08:45.919 --> 08:48.080
You're Young Madam's most trusted first-class maid.

141
08:48.240 --> 08:50.120
You could marry a head shopkeeper.

142
08:50.559 --> 08:52.200
Of course my brother would be willing.

143
08:52.799 --> 08:54.679
He just wouldn't dare dream of it.

144
08:55.720 --> 08:57.080
I don't need to marry a shopkeeper.

145
08:57.679 --> 08:58.759
I can write,

146
08:59.120 --> 08:59.960
keep accounts,

147
09:00.000 --> 09:00.960
and run a business.

148
09:01.200 --> 09:03.200
Someday, I can become a shopkeeper myself.

149
09:05.440 --> 09:08.399
Exactly. From now on, my brother can follow Gantang's lead.

150
09:08.440 --> 09:10.136
The wife leads, and the husband follows.

151
09:12.720 --> 09:14.519
My family's debts have all been paid off.

152
09:15.200 --> 09:17.519
My brother will finish his apprenticeship this year.

153
09:18.200 --> 09:19.039
My mother said

154
09:19.240 --> 09:21.140
that as long as we work hard and stay diligent,

155
09:21.159 --> 09:22.720
and the whole family works together,

156
09:23.000 --> 09:25.000
we'll definitely build a good life.

157
09:30.720 --> 09:32.320
I'll make the decision

158
09:34.039 --> 09:35.080
about Gantang's marriage.

159
09:36.000 --> 09:37.720
She will marry Du Dasong.

160
09:41.480 --> 09:42.399
Thank you, Young Madam.

161
09:42.919 --> 09:43.960
Thank you, Young Madam.

162
09:56.440 --> 09:58.200
And why are you two kneeling?

163
09:59.320 --> 09:59.840
I...

164
10:01.919 --> 10:02.960
I won't be a concubine.

165
10:03.352 --> 10:04.550
I don't want to get married.

166
10:06.600 --> 10:08.759
They heard that First Madam was choosing a maid

167
10:08.760 --> 10:11.320
to send to the Yuan Residence as Third Young Master's concubine,

168
10:11.352 --> 10:12.550
so they both panicked

169
10:12.799 --> 10:15.200
and hurried over to beg you for mercy.

170
10:18.000 --> 10:19.000
Don't worry.

171
10:20.799 --> 10:21.879
First Madam wants someone

172
10:22.080 --> 10:23.639
who's willing.

173
10:24.344 --> 10:25.630
Neither of you will be chosen.

174
10:29.320 --> 10:31.000
Thank you, Young Madam.

175
10:35.759 --> 10:37.519
Young Madam, Captain Lin...

176
10:38.320 --> 10:39.440
Nanke is here to see you.

177
10:40.120 --> 10:41.519
Nanke wants to see me?

178
11:01.279 --> 11:02.919
I came to see you so suddenly today

179
11:03.600 --> 11:04.919
because I heard something

180
11:05.960 --> 11:07.159
that troubled me,

181
11:07.352 --> 11:09.000
so I took the liberty of coming here.

182
11:09.720 --> 11:10.519
What is it?

183
11:16.639 --> 11:18.440
I'd like to ask for the hand of your maid,

184
11:24.200 --> 11:24.919
Du Xiaolian.

185
11:35.399 --> 11:36.799
That's you.

186
11:37.360 --> 11:38.200
What?

187
11:39.600 --> 11:40.919
He wants to marry me?

188
11:53.320 --> 11:54.399
You should go back for now.

189
11:54.960 --> 11:57.519
I'll have to ask Xiaolian what she thinks.

190
12:02.480 --> 12:03.279
Yes.

191
12:10.200 --> 12:11.679
Third son-in-law's concubine

192
12:11.960 --> 12:13.679
won't be a maid from Zhichun Hall.

193
12:18.600 --> 12:19.600
Thank you, Young Madam.

194
12:27.600 --> 12:28.759
Xiaolian.

195
12:29.279 --> 12:30.679
Xiaolian.

196
12:32.480 --> 12:33.279
Congratulations!

197
12:33.280 --> 12:35.600
Nanke is a deputy company commander appointed by His Majesty himself.

198
12:35.639 --> 12:37.440
Fortune really does favor the simplehearted.

199
12:37.759 --> 12:39.759
With Xiaolian's absentminded nature,

200
12:39.840 --> 12:41.240
she should find someone like Nanke,

201
12:41.256 --> 12:42.440
who's sharp and capable.

202
12:43.256 --> 12:44.550
Don't get carried away just yet.

203
12:45.320 --> 12:46.720
Xiaolian hasn't agreed.

204
12:49.160 --> 12:50.750
I'll have to ask my mother about this.

205
12:50.840 --> 12:51.720
Oh, come on.

206
12:51.750 --> 12:53.496
Your mother will definitely listen to you.

207
13:18.759 --> 13:19.240
Yes.

208
13:21.039 --> 13:23.440
Congratulations, Xiaolian!

209
13:23.440 --> 13:25.559
You kept this well hidden.

210
13:57.260 --> 14:00.820
♪I open the window and sunlight floods the city♪

211
14:01.500 --> 14:05.260
♪I hold a little flower picked by the roadside♪

212
14:05.580 --> 14:09.660
♪Who's secretly peeking again?♪

213
14:10.220 --> 14:14.140
♪The breeze carries fragrance through the streets♪

214
14:14.860 --> 14:18.380
♪The simmering tea brings back warm memories of days gone by♪

215
14:18.740 --> 14:22.780
♪Who breaks the stillness of the long afternoon?♪

216
14:25.919 --> 14:28.519
Congratulations! Two happy occasions at once!

217
14:30.919 --> 14:32.360
Wonderful!

218
14:32.360 --> 14:35.919
Congratulations!

219
14:35.920 --> 14:38.470
Xiaolian's mother, congratulations! Two happy occasions at once!

220
14:38.488 --> 14:40.740
♪Copper coins jingle in my pocket♪

221
14:41.140 --> 14:44.660
♪I'll trade them for a pot of liquor and toast the setting sun♪

222
14:44.840 --> 14:46.480
Madam, congratulations.

223
14:49.840 --> 14:50.600
Congratulations.

224
14:53.220 --> 14:55.980
♪Listening to Granny tell stories of days gone by♪

225
14:55.980 --> 14:58.540
♪We laugh until our eyes glisten with tears♪

226
14:58.540 --> 15:02.740
♪Treasured by you and me, these warm and fragrant moments♪

227
15:02.740 --> 15:05.820
♪We quietly wander through the bustle of everyday life♪

228
15:05.820 --> 15:09.340
♪There's no need to make a fuss♪

229
15:25.000 --> 15:26.600
It's all homemade liquor.

230
15:26.600 --> 15:27.848
The alcohol content is very low.

231
15:27.960 --> 15:30.000
Have plenty.

232
15:33.560 --> 15:34.270
Everyone, cheers!

233
15:34.280 --> 15:35.560
Cheers! Make yourselves at home.

234
15:35.576 --> 15:36.780
- Cheers! - All right.

235
15:38.919 --> 15:39.759
Have some more.

236
15:40.360 --> 15:41.200
Groom,

237
15:41.519 --> 15:42.679
get them drunk.

238
15:53.360 --> 15:54.080
You're

239
15:54.600 --> 15:56.639
worried about Jiugao's marriage, aren't you?

240
15:59.039 --> 16:00.159
He's already in his thirties

241
16:00.160 --> 16:01.340
and still hasn't found anyone.

242
16:01.368 --> 16:02.440
How could I not worry?

243
16:05.000 --> 16:05.799
Actually,

244
16:06.200 --> 16:07.960
Jiugao is quite a catch.

245
16:08.720 --> 16:10.519
Could it be that your standards are too high?

246
16:11.000 --> 16:12.320
In the early years,

247
16:12.600 --> 16:13.960
I did have high expectations.

248
16:14.840 --> 16:16.399
But after all these years,

249
16:16.520 --> 16:18.550
I'm like an old soybean ground beneath a millstone.

250
16:18.759 --> 16:20.600
Those expectations have long been ground away.

251
16:20.710 --> 16:23.140
I don't care if she's never married or has been married before,

252
16:23.150 --> 16:24.490
or whether she's pretty or plain.

253
16:24.600 --> 16:25.960
As long as she's a woman

254
16:26.240 --> 16:28.240
who doesn't mind Jiugao, that's enough.

255
16:28.600 --> 16:30.720
Do you really mean that?

256
16:31.960 --> 16:33.039
When I give my word,

257
16:33.399 --> 16:34.679
it's set in stone.

258
16:35.200 --> 16:36.000
I mean it.

259
16:40.399 --> 16:42.759
I mean it. Come, let's drink.

260
16:43.360 --> 16:44.720
Nanny, what do you think of me?

261
16:48.399 --> 16:49.320
You?

262
16:53.720 --> 16:54.960
You mean...

263
16:58.840 --> 16:59.320
Mother.

264
17:02.759 --> 17:05.039
Yuchan and I love each other

265
17:11.656 --> 17:13.416
and wish to become husband and wife.

266
17:23.559 --> 17:24.759
I'm all alone,

267
17:25.240 --> 17:26.680
with no parents or siblings.

268
17:26.872 --> 17:28.400
Ever since I came to the Lin Residence,

269
17:28.920 --> 17:30.400
you've treated me like a daughter.

270
17:32.240 --> 17:33.039
Before,

271
17:33.960 --> 17:36.079
I always felt I wasn't good enough for Jiugao

272
17:36.640 --> 17:37.880
and kept avoiding him.

273
17:38.840 --> 17:41.000
But after spending so long by Young Madam's side,

274
17:41.599 --> 17:43.039
I've changed my thinking.

275
17:45.480 --> 17:46.759
I may be an orphan,

276
17:47.016 --> 17:48.680
but I've always relied on my own strength,

277
17:48.776 --> 17:50.160
and I've never stopped learning.

278
17:50.799 --> 17:52.519
Reading, keeping accounts,

279
17:52.799 --> 17:54.799
needlework, cooking, I'm good at them all.

280
17:55.440 --> 17:56.960
I also truly care for Jiugao

281
17:57.319 --> 17:58.599
and respect you, Nanny.

282
18:04.359 --> 18:05.319
Jiugao and I

283
18:07.176 --> 18:08.720
are well matched in both character

284
18:09.440 --> 18:10.400
and ability.

285
18:23.160 --> 18:24.559
You little rascal!

286
18:25.160 --> 18:26.319
You little rascal!

287
18:26.720 --> 18:27.799
You little rascal!

288
18:29.000 --> 18:31.160
Always putting on an act and fooling people!

289
18:31.832 --> 18:34.008
You never speak plainly when you have something to say.

290
18:34.280 --> 18:35.350
Always putting on an act.

291
18:35.384 --> 18:36.720
You've ruined your own reputation,

292
18:37.000 --> 18:37.839
and now Yuchan,

293
18:44.720 --> 18:45.880
your wife,

294
18:47.000 --> 18:48.640
has to suffer because of you

295
18:50.480 --> 18:52.000
and endure people's gossip.

296
18:52.664 --> 18:53.960
Spare the rod for three days,

297
18:53.960 --> 18:56.559
and you little rascal will tear the roof apart!

298
18:56.648 --> 18:58.480
You little rascal! I'll beat you senseless!

299
18:58.480 --> 19:00.680
I'll beat you! Take that!

300
19:00.759 --> 19:01.640
Take that!

301
19:02.640 --> 19:03.920
Careful, you'll hurt your hand.

302
19:04.168 --> 19:06.160
I'll find you a stick so you can keep beating.

303
19:07.039 --> 19:08.519
I'll beat you! Take that!

304
19:08.720 --> 19:09.759
All right.

305
19:10.839 --> 19:12.599
That's enough. You've vented your anger.

306
19:12.599 --> 19:13.680
This is a happy occasion.

307
19:14.720 --> 19:15.599
I think

308
19:15.920 --> 19:17.880
we should take advantage of this auspicious day.

309
19:17.920 --> 19:18.880
I'll make the decision

310
19:19.119 --> 19:20.319
and play matchmaker this once.

311
19:20.920 --> 19:22.400
Everyone here can be our witness.

312
19:22.559 --> 19:25.000
Let's settle Yuchan and Jiugao's marriage

313
19:25.039 --> 19:26.960
today. What do you say?

314
19:27.000 --> 19:29.480
- Good! - Good!

315
19:30.599 --> 19:31.720
Come.

316
19:34.640 --> 19:34.960
Come.

317
19:36.359 --> 19:36.960
Come.

318
19:38.279 --> 19:39.240
Nanny.

319
19:39.660 --> 19:41.340
♪My longing fills my eyes♪

320
19:43.608 --> 19:44.750
This truly is wonderful news.

321
19:48.319 --> 19:52.200
Everyone, be sure to come back for the wedding feast.

322
19:52.599 --> 19:53.680
Of course.

323
19:54.039 --> 19:55.079
Congratulations!

324
19:55.720 --> 19:57.079
Come, cheers!

325
19:57.480 --> 19:58.359
I'm so happy.

326
19:58.359 --> 20:01.319
Three happy occasions at once! Three happy occasions!

327
20:01.319 --> 20:03.820
♪Love lingers all around us♪

328
20:04.740 --> 20:06.968
♪Holding hands through this life, breathing...♪

329
20:07.359 --> 20:11.519
- Chrysanthemum greens! - Taste the freshness of spring!

330
20:11.599 --> 20:15.839
- Fresh and tender! - Come and buy!

331
20:16.000 --> 20:20.079
- Chrysanthemum greens! - Come and buy!

332
20:20.400 --> 20:23.559
- Chrysanthemum greens! - Taste the freshness of spring!

333
20:41.688 --> 20:42.640
(Yang Cong) Today, we

334
20:42.759 --> 20:45.359
(Lin Xiushu's husband) came especially to bring you good news.

335
20:46.960 --> 20:48.039
Good news?

336
20:56.640 --> 20:57.880
You two...

337
20:59.200 --> 21:00.119
Mother,

338
21:00.400 --> 21:01.240
Xiushu

339
21:01.960 --> 21:02.960
is with child.

340
21:04.696 --> 21:05.880
It's been over three months,

341
21:05.920 --> 21:07.220
and the pregnancy is now stable.

342
21:07.759 --> 21:09.640
So we came especially to bring you the good news

343
21:09.960 --> 21:12.000
and let you and Father share in our joy.

344
21:14.400 --> 21:16.119
This is wonderful news.

345
21:16.759 --> 21:18.000
Thank the Bodhisattva.

346
21:19.200 --> 21:22.160
Now I could die without regret.

347
21:30.359 --> 21:32.480
Spit that away. May all evil be warded off.

348
21:34.240 --> 21:37.000
I got carried away with joy.

349
21:37.799 --> 21:39.000
Cong is right.

350
21:39.759 --> 21:42.519
Spit that away. May all evil be warded off.

351
21:44.000 --> 21:45.000
Let's choose a day,

352
21:45.640 --> 21:47.839
and Mother and I will go outside the city

353
21:48.240 --> 21:51.160
to kowtow and offer incense to the Bodhisattva.

354
21:53.440 --> 21:54.319
All right.

355
21:56.480 --> 21:57.599
Let's choose a day.

356
22:02.000 --> 22:03.119
Young Madam is in labor.

357
22:05.880 --> 22:06.480
Quick!

358
22:06.599 --> 22:08.599
Go get the midwives and the female physician.

359
22:08.640 --> 22:10.424
Young Madam has made all the arrangements.

360
22:10.440 --> 22:11.920
Two midwives and a female physician

361
22:11.920 --> 22:13.319
are attending her at Zhichun Hall.

362
22:13.720 --> 22:16.480
Someone has also been sent to inform her mother.

363
22:16.839 --> 22:17.240
Good.

364
22:18.359 --> 22:19.279
That's good.

365
22:24.000 --> 22:24.640
You

366
22:24.960 --> 22:26.920
should learn from your sister-in-law.

367
22:27.079 --> 22:28.599
Cherish your blessings and your life.

368
22:28.960 --> 22:30.759
Always prepare for what may come

369
22:31.480 --> 22:34.039
and put your own well-being first.

370
22:37.960 --> 22:39.160
Taking good care of yourself

371
22:39.759 --> 22:42.400
is the greatest filial devotion you can show your parents.

372
22:44.200 --> 22:45.319
I'll remember that.

373
22:46.599 --> 22:47.400
Good.

374
22:47.864 --> 22:49.850
Anyone Lanxiang has used before must be reliable.

375
22:49.900 --> 22:51.270
When we get back, I'll send someone

376
22:51.288 --> 22:53.190
to bring the midwives and female physician over.

377
22:53.200 --> 22:54.810
I'll make sure Xiushu is well cared for.

378
22:55.720 --> 22:56.319
Good.

379
22:58.960 --> 23:00.559
Xiushu and I will head back first.

380
23:00.760 --> 23:01.740
We'll come again tomorrow

381
23:01.759 --> 23:03.119
to congratulate Jinqi and Lanxiang.

382
23:03.960 --> 23:05.599
I need to hurry to Zhichun Hall, too,

383
23:05.759 --> 23:07.039
so I won't keep you any longer.

384
23:43.750 --> 23:44.536
Push!

385
23:44.540 --> 23:46.110
Bring another bowl of brown sugar water.

386
23:46.119 --> 23:47.559
Quick, breathe in.

387
23:47.599 --> 23:51.480
Breathe in. Breathe out. Push!

388
23:52.000 --> 23:53.319
Young Madam, don't be nervous.

389
23:53.320 --> 23:55.816
The baby is in the right position. Just do as you've practiced.

390
23:56.039 --> 23:56.839
Keep going.

391
23:58.200 --> 23:59.039
Don't be nervous.

392
23:59.040 --> 24:00.216
Just do what you normally do.

393
24:01.000 --> 24:01.799
Come, breathe in.

394
24:01.992 --> 24:03.480
Breathe in. Let me check your pulse.

395
24:03.720 --> 24:04.519
Breathe in. Come on.

396
24:06.319 --> 24:08.039
Good. Young Master Lin, don't be nervous.

397
24:08.152 --> 24:09.350
Young Madam is in good health,

398
24:09.359 --> 24:11.310
and she stayed active throughout her pregnancy.

399
24:11.320 --> 24:12.490
She'll have a smooth delivery.

400
24:12.839 --> 24:14.880
Come, breathe in. Push!

401
24:15.440 --> 24:16.519
Push!

402
24:18.079 --> 24:20.079
How can a man be in here?

403
24:20.519 --> 24:22.319
Childbirth is considered inauspicious.

404
24:23.119 --> 24:24.279
Ask Young Master to leave.

405
24:24.648 --> 24:25.850
Bringing a child into the world

406
24:25.920 --> 24:27.440
is how the family line continues.

407
24:27.590 --> 24:28.808
How could that be inauspicious?

408
24:29.096 --> 24:31.480
It's clearly one of the most auspicious things in the world.

409
24:32.240 --> 24:34.720
Back when we were giving birth,

410
24:35.279 --> 24:36.680
Master and Changmin

411
24:36.920 --> 24:38.319
were nowhere to be seen,

412
24:38.880 --> 24:41.079
not even outside the room, let alone inside.

413
24:41.768 --> 24:44.000
That should have been auspicious enough, shouldn't it?

414
24:44.480 --> 24:45.799
Yet after all these decades,

415
24:46.640 --> 24:48.440
I haven't seen either of them accomplish much

416
24:48.720 --> 24:50.200
for the country or the family.

417
24:50.359 --> 24:59.039
Push! Keep going! Come on, push!

418
25:17.279 --> 25:18.759
Push harder! Push!

419
25:18.880 --> 25:19.440
Come quickly!

420
25:19.440 --> 25:20.640
Fainted! Unconscious now!

421
25:21.240 --> 25:21.880
Come here!

422
25:22.039 --> 25:23.119
Hurry over here!

423
25:23.160 --> 25:23.680
Come on!

424
25:24.119 --> 25:25.440
Quick, press the philtrum.

425
25:25.759 --> 25:26.200
Over here!

426
25:27.720 --> 25:28.599
Quick, come here!

427
25:28.920 --> 25:30.160
Hurry over here!

428
25:36.880 --> 25:39.000
Mother and daughter are safe!

429
25:39.000 --> 25:40.640
Wonderful!

430
25:40.640 --> 25:43.680
- Mother and daughter are safe! - Mother and daughter are safe!

431
25:43.680 --> 25:44.380
The baby's born!

432
25:47.279 --> 25:48.200
Wonderful!

433
25:48.359 --> 25:50.200
Why did Young Master Lin faint?

434
25:50.200 --> 25:51.039
Quick!

435
25:51.039 --> 25:52.160
Press his philtrum again!

436
25:53.039 --> 25:54.720
So it was Jinqi who fainted.

437
25:54.759 --> 25:55.759
He scared me to death.

438
25:55.799 --> 25:57.160
Wake up, Young Master!

439
25:57.640 --> 25:58.759
Young Master, wake up!

440
25:58.839 --> 26:00.680
Young Master, wake up!

441
26:00.759 --> 26:02.599
Young Master!

442
26:02.640 --> 26:04.480
Young Master, can you hear me?

443
26:05.000 --> 26:07.279
- Young Master, wake up. - The baby's here!

444
26:07.839 --> 26:10.359
Young Madam, the baby's here.

445
26:11.079 --> 26:11.960
Young Master, wake up!

446
26:11.960 --> 26:14.240
Look how adorable she is.

447
26:21.640 --> 26:24.160
Young Master Lin is awake! He's awake!

448
26:27.480 --> 26:29.279
I told you he shouldn't have gone in.

449
26:32.119 --> 26:34.119
How are you? Are you all right?

450
26:35.880 --> 26:36.839
Young Master Lin,

451
26:38.079 --> 26:39.519
you're a father now.

452
26:48.039 --> 26:49.279
You've been through a lot.

453
26:59.119 --> 27:00.079
It's all right now.

454
27:02.039 --> 27:03.079
A girl.

455
27:04.079 --> 27:04.960
A girl.

456
27:10.279 --> 27:11.720
Shunhua doesn't have

457
27:11.720 --> 27:13.559
that awful habit of favoring sons.

458
27:13.880 --> 27:16.319
Now this little girl is the only girl

459
27:16.359 --> 27:18.359
among the Lin family's great-grandchildren.

460
27:19.519 --> 27:21.079
Not only is Shunhua delighted,

461
27:21.279 --> 27:22.440
but even Old Master also

462
27:22.640 --> 27:24.559
chose a name for her long ago.

463
27:27.200 --> 27:28.000
That's wonderful.

464
27:50.839 --> 27:52.119
According to the genealogy,

465
27:52.960 --> 27:54.279
their generation

466
27:54.312 --> 27:55.890
uses the character Zhang in their names.

467
27:56.400 --> 27:57.400
Grandfather said

468
27:58.000 --> 27:59.720
whether it's a boy or a girl,

469
28:00.160 --> 28:01.640
the child will be named Zhangcheng.

470
28:02.119 --> 28:04.680
Cheng means purity.

471
28:05.432 --> 28:07.070
(Lin Zhangcheng, daughter) Zhangcheng.

472
28:07.080 --> 28:08.820
(of Lin Jinqi and Xu Lanxiang) I hope that as you grow,

473
28:08.820 --> 28:10.880
you'll learn to reflect on yourself,

474
28:11.000 --> 28:12.880
and preserve a pure heart.

475
28:14.960 --> 28:16.000
Zhangcheng.

476
28:17.359 --> 28:18.519
That's a good name.

477
28:21.640 --> 28:24.720
Why are you just staring at me and smiling?

478
28:26.279 --> 28:27.680
You still haven't told me

479
28:28.640 --> 28:30.240
why you fainted.

480
28:31.640 --> 28:33.799
My mother thought I'd fainted

481
28:34.400 --> 28:37.240
and nearly scared herself out of her wits.

482
28:38.519 --> 28:39.839
You were

483
28:40.440 --> 28:42.160
bleeding so much.

484
28:42.799 --> 28:44.599
Then the midwife pulled out

485
28:44.599 --> 28:46.160
a tiny baby covered in blood.

486
28:47.279 --> 28:49.440
I don't know what happened,

487
28:50.240 --> 28:51.720
but my chest suddenly tightened,

488
28:51.880 --> 28:53.039
everything went black,

489
28:54.119 --> 28:56.000
and I lost consciousness.

490
29:00.279 --> 29:01.440
Your husband

491
29:01.440 --> 29:03.319
is no coward who scares easily.

492
29:03.960 --> 29:05.000
It was really...

493
29:06.559 --> 29:07.759
It was really...

494
29:09.279 --> 29:10.240
It was really...

495
29:10.504 --> 29:12.200
because you were so worried about me.

496
29:18.720 --> 29:20.200
Truly...

497
29:21.680 --> 29:22.960
For a woman, the birthing room

498
29:23.368 --> 29:25.030
is no less dangerous than a battlefield.

499
29:26.279 --> 29:29.480
And no one can take your place or fight alongside you.

500
29:30.720 --> 29:32.839
You have to face it all alone.

501
29:35.799 --> 29:36.720
For my sake,

502
29:38.319 --> 29:39.519
you've been through so much.

503
29:42.559 --> 29:43.680
It wasn't for you.

504
29:46.480 --> 29:47.759
It was for her.

505
29:51.279 --> 29:52.079
This battle

506
29:52.960 --> 29:55.039
was one I willingly fought.

507
30:00.079 --> 30:00.960
Just as

508
30:01.920 --> 30:03.559
Mother did for me,

509
30:04.359 --> 30:06.200
enduring a day and a night of labor

510
30:08.079 --> 30:10.000
to bring me into this world.

511
30:14.860 --> 30:18.340
♪The evening breeze blows past distant hills♪

512
30:19.420 --> 30:22.580
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

513
30:23.460 --> 30:27.620
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

514
30:27.620 --> 30:34.580
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

515
30:53.200 --> 30:53.880
Madam.

516
30:56.759 --> 30:59.680
We should tell Young Master and Young Madam.

517
31:00.240 --> 31:01.039
No.

518
31:02.640 --> 31:04.440
This is Young Madam's first childbirth.

519
31:04.968 --> 31:06.920
She needs to rest properly during her confinement

520
31:07.039 --> 31:08.720
and recover fully.

521
31:10.079 --> 31:11.680
If she learns that I'm ill,

522
31:12.160 --> 31:14.279
she'll insist on tending to me at my bedside.

523
31:15.000 --> 31:17.240
If she ends up like me

524
31:17.680 --> 31:19.160
with an illness from her confinement,

525
31:20.279 --> 31:22.680
she'll suffer from it for the rest of her life.

526
31:30.119 --> 31:31.000
Go on.

527
31:41.960 --> 31:43.200
Madam, your illness

528
31:44.759 --> 31:46.119
can't be left untreated any longer.

529
31:49.519 --> 31:51.319
I can hold on

530
31:51.519 --> 31:53.319
until Young Madam finishes her confinement.

531
31:57.279 --> 31:58.880
But you've had it hard.

532
31:59.559 --> 32:01.599
You're already a mother-in-law yourself,

533
32:02.200 --> 32:05.119
yet instead of enjoying time with your family at home,

534
32:06.480 --> 32:08.279
you still have to come and care for me.

535
32:10.839 --> 32:12.960
Madam, don't say such foolish things.

536
32:15.000 --> 32:15.720
You and I

537
32:16.960 --> 32:18.759
grew up together.

538
32:20.000 --> 32:21.759
We may be madam and servant in name,

539
32:22.880 --> 32:23.720
but in truth,

540
32:24.200 --> 32:26.039
you've always treated me like a sister.

541
32:27.039 --> 32:28.559
When Jiugao's father passed away,

542
32:30.000 --> 32:31.880
you were afraid I might do something desperate,

543
32:33.160 --> 32:35.319
so you stayed by my side day and night.

544
32:41.119 --> 32:42.440
I know your hardships

545
32:44.279 --> 32:45.720
better than anyone.

546
32:46.599 --> 32:47.680
And you know mine

547
32:49.119 --> 32:51.119
better than anyone.

548
32:53.480 --> 32:54.160
Now,

549
32:55.680 --> 32:57.200
being able to stay by your side

550
32:59.160 --> 33:00.440
makes me happy.

551
33:01.960 --> 33:03.079
I'm happy.

552
33:06.640 --> 33:07.799
All these years,

553
33:09.119 --> 33:10.480
through every hardship,

554
33:17.079 --> 33:19.119
I've had you by my side.

555
33:21.720 --> 33:23.519
That has made me very happy, too.

556
33:27.119 --> 33:28.960
Very happy.

557
33:36.519 --> 33:37.279
All right.

558
33:38.759 --> 33:39.799
No more crying.

559
33:52.759 --> 33:56.279
Our little Zhangcheng is such a good girl.

560
33:57.200 --> 33:59.599
Mother is going to sleep.

561
34:00.640 --> 34:03.920
We won't cry or fuss.

562
34:05.559 --> 34:06.759
She's asleep.

563
34:08.000 --> 34:10.480
Bring the pillow over for me.

564
34:23.360 --> 34:26.480
Time for sleep.

565
34:30.559 --> 34:32.280
Look at that sweet little face.

566
34:32.280 --> 34:33.656
(Lin Zhangcheng, two months old)

567
34:47.224 --> 34:48.710
Mother, thank you for all your help.

568
34:51.119 --> 34:53.880
It's no trouble. Just looking at Zhangcheng

569
34:54.280 --> 34:55.400
makes my heart

570
34:55.480 --> 34:57.679
feel as sweet as honey.

571
35:00.920 --> 35:02.079
The midwife also said

572
35:02.599 --> 35:04.480
Zhangcheng was a considerate child

573
35:04.664 --> 35:06.632
who hardly put her mother through any trouble

574
35:06.800 --> 35:08.159
and was born without difficulty.

575
35:10.519 --> 35:12.280
Our Zhangcheng

576
35:12.719 --> 35:14.320
is just like Lanxiang.

577
35:15.719 --> 35:17.280
Back then, I

578
35:18.679 --> 35:20.519
went into the birthing room at noon

579
35:21.880 --> 35:25.360
and gave birth before nightfall.

580
35:31.360 --> 35:34.000
Just as Mother did for me,

581
35:35.320 --> 35:37.159
enduring a day and a night of labor

582
35:39.039 --> 35:41.039
to bring me into this world.

583
35:57.119 --> 35:59.360
Then Zhangcheng is just as considerate as Lanxiang.

584
36:00.079 --> 36:02.480
She was born in only half a day?

585
36:03.599 --> 36:04.719
That's right.

586
36:05.679 --> 36:07.800
Just like her mother.

587
36:08.280 --> 36:10.400
They're both our precious little darlings.

588
36:11.239 --> 36:15.760
Grandmother's precious little treasure.

589
36:19.360 --> 36:20.360
I'll go to the study

590
36:20.568 --> 36:22.230
and reply to a few letters from friends.

591
36:22.639 --> 36:24.960
I'll leave Zhangcheng in your care, Mother.

592
36:25.800 --> 36:27.679
Go on. I've got her.

593
36:33.000 --> 36:37.000
Little toes, let's stretch them.

594
36:38.360 --> 36:40.880
Stretch them all the way to Nanshan.

595
36:42.280 --> 36:45.679
There's a treasure in Nanshan.

596
36:46.400 --> 36:49.719
The treasure has a mountain of gold.

597
36:50.639 --> 36:54.960
And on that mountain lie 1.2 hectares of fields.

598
37:16.980 --> 37:27.060
(Take only what you need, and build upon it slowly)

599
37:55.440 --> 37:58.039
(The person Lanxiang painted, judging by his clothes,)

600
37:58.320 --> 37:59.880
(is a stagehand from our troupe.)

601
38:07.832 --> 38:10.790
(Third Place Scholar Han is renowned throughout the court for his learning)

602
38:10.800 --> 38:12.200
(and is highly skilled in painting.)

603
38:13.199 --> 38:14.480
(Lanxiang's painting skills)

604
38:14.568 --> 38:16.920
(are no less accomplished than Third Place Scholar Han's.)

605
38:34.056 --> 38:36.072
(Calligraphy and painting share the same roots.)

606
38:36.360 --> 38:37.840
(Both depend on mastery of the brush.)

607
38:38.599 --> 38:40.679
(The figures are vividly and lifelike drawn.)

608
38:40.760 --> 38:42.000
(Her brushwork is exquisite.)

609
38:42.519 --> 38:43.400
(Yuchan. Lanxiang) (There's no way her handwriting)

610
38:43.440 --> 38:45.280
(could look like that of a child who has only just learned to hold a brush.)

611
38:45.719 --> 38:46.800
My writing isn't good.

612
38:47.000 --> 38:49.199
I'll show it to you when I've improved.

613
38:50.679 --> 38:51.920
(You're well-versed in music?)

614
38:52.039 --> 38:54.440
(Old Master Lin runs his household well.)

615
38:54.920 --> 38:57.719
(Even the maids in the residence are remarkably perceptive.)

616
38:57.719 --> 38:59.430
(This maid of yours is quite interesting.)

617
38:59.440 --> 39:01.540
(On her first visit to a military camp, she showed no fear at all.)

618
39:01.559 --> 39:03.360
(Lanxiang truly is remarkable.)

619
39:27.000 --> 39:28.880
(What exactly are you hiding?)

620
39:31.519 --> 39:33.920
(Or perhaps I should ask,)

621
39:36.079 --> 39:37.440
(who exactly are you?)

622
39:49.079 --> 39:50.039
Where's the baby?

623
39:54.199 --> 39:55.400
Mother is looking after her.

624
40:02.000 --> 40:02.960
What's wrong?

625
40:05.912 --> 40:08.024
I've been talking so much while soothing the baby

626
40:08.400 --> 40:09.719
that my throat is a little dry.

627
40:13.559 --> 40:15.079
What's in your box?

628
40:15.639 --> 40:17.280
Why do you look so nervous?

629
40:23.519 --> 40:24.119
Do I?

630
40:26.679 --> 40:28.360
You brought it right in front of me,

631
40:28.440 --> 40:29.679
yet you won't let me see it.

632
40:30.248 --> 40:31.944
What treasure are you keeping in there?

633
42:00.180 --> 42:04.140
(Zhichun Hall Daily Expense Account Book)

634
42:15.519 --> 42:16.960
That's very thoughtful of you.

635
42:16.960 --> 42:20.380
(Zhichun Hall Daily Expense Account Book)

636
42:21.519 --> 42:23.159
Even these little things

637
42:24.559 --> 42:26.000
have all been carefully preserved.

638
42:27.440 --> 42:29.079
I've always loved you with all my heart.

639
42:33.400 --> 42:35.320
Now that we have a child,

640
42:38.239 --> 42:40.519
surely you can tell me where they came from.

641
43:05.100 --> 43:07.580
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

642
43:10.800 --> 43:11.639
Just cry.

643
43:14.920 --> 43:16.360
As children,

644
43:19.288 --> 43:21.032
we wish to care for our parents,

645
43:21.464 --> 43:23.592
but they may be gone before we have the chance.

646
43:31.960 --> 43:33.400
I'll cry with you.

647
43:36.300 --> 43:40.500
♪Even if these trials consume my whole life♪

648
43:41.420 --> 43:45.420
♪I'll only return to the moment our fate began♪

649
43:45.740 --> 43:49.180
♪I've searched and searched, wandering in circles♪

650
43:49.180 --> 43:52.220
♪Yet I still can't mend the dreams of the past♪

651
43:52.220 --> 43:55.420
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

652
43:55.420 --> 43:59.900
♪Thankfully, these trials have spared me a lifetime♪

653
44:00.340 --> 44:05.420
♪In this life and the next, it will always be you♪

654
44:05.420 --> 44:14.460
♪I only pray that fate lets us meet sooner♪

655
44:34.981 --> 44:39.101
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

656
44:41.941 --> 44:46.461
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

657
44:47.741 --> 44:51.661
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

658
44:52.341 --> 44:55.101
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

659
44:55.821 --> 44:58.141
♪Though all the world may fade♪

660
44:58.141 --> 45:01.221
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

661
45:02.741 --> 45:06.981
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

662
45:09.901 --> 45:14.061
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

663
45:15.861 --> 45:19.421
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

664
45:19.421 --> 45:22.981
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

665
45:23.781 --> 45:29.461
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

666
45:29.821 --> 45:34.141
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

667
45:34.501 --> 45:37.461
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

668
45:37.461 --> 45:41.221
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

669
45:41.221 --> 45:44.101
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

670
45:44.101 --> 45:48.181
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

671
45:48.181 --> 45:51.541
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

672
45:51.541 --> 45:55.301
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

673
45:55.301 --> 45:59.301
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

